# Karam Al Arab ERP

Internal logistics and trading ERP for karam-alarab.com. Read `AGENTS.md`, `.cursor/skills/karam-alarab-domain/SKILL.md`, `.cursor/skills/ddd-architecture/SKILL.md`, and `.cursor/skills/tech-stack/SKILL.md` before any change.

- Architecture is DDD (modular monolith, bounded contexts, small aggregates).
- Stack is FastAPI + React. No NestJS, Next.js, or Prisma.
- English default, Russian in the same release. Prepare RTL, do not ship Arabic yet.
- Domain words: shipment, cargo, 3PL, FTL, LTL, trading, compensation.
- Money: decimal AED. Time: store UTC, show Asia/Dubai.
- Load the senior frontend, backend, UI/UX, QA, or cybersecurity skill that matches the task.
- Security work is defensive only. No exploit code or attack procedures.
- Do not reuse leftover “Talal Logistics” copy from the marketing site.
